{"model": "kokoro", "mode": "pipeline_iter", "text_id": "blind_01", "text": "Bom dia. Antes de começarmos a reunião, eu queria agradecer o esforço de todo mundo nesta entrega.", "voice": "pf_dora", "lang_code": "p", "first_chunk_latency_ms": 951.4208890032023, "audio_path": "<internal-src>/tts/benchmarks/kokoro/20260420_145808/kokoro/blind_01.wav", "sample_rate": 24000, "audio_duration_s": 6.125, "synth_time_s": 0.9514309539808892, "rtf": 0.15533566595606355, "peak_rss_mb": 1949.7109375, "peak_cuda_mb": 679.74560546875, "error": null}
{"model": "kokoro", "mode": "pipeline_iter", "text_id": "blind_02", "text": "A chuva passou durante a madrugada e a cidade amanheceu silenciosa, com um vento frio vindo do mar.", "voice": "pf_dora", "lang_code": "p", "first_chunk_latency_ms": 171.47284100065008, "audio_path": "<internal-src>/tts/benchmarks/kokoro/20260420_145808/kokoro/blind_02.wav", "sample_rate": 24000, "audio_duration_s": 5.875, "synth_time_s": 0.17148357001133263, "rtf": 0.029188692767886406, "peak_rss_mb": 1971.7109375, "peak_cuda_mb": 679.74560546875, "error": null}
{"model": "kokoro", "mode": "pipeline_iter", "text_id": "blind_03", "text": "Quando a gravação termina muito rápido, algumas vogais ficam espremidas e a frase perde naturalidade.", "voice": "pf_dora", "lang_code": "p", "first_chunk_latency_ms": 166.8434119783342, "audio_path": "<internal-src>/tts/benchmarks/kokoro/20260420_145808/kokoro/blind_03.wav", "sample_rate": 24000, "audio_duration_s": 6.4, "synth_time_s": 0.1668525459826924, "rtf": 0.026070710309795686, "peak_rss_mb": 2011.83984375, "peak_cuda_mb": 679.74560546875, "error": null}
{"model": "kokoro", "mode": "pipeline_iter", "text_id": "blind_04", "text": "Ela respondeu com calma, mas ainda dava para perceber a ansiedade escondida atrás de cada pausa.", "voice": "pf_dora", "lang_code": "p", "first_chunk_latency_ms": 159.97350600082427, "audio_path": "<internal-src>/tts/benchmarks/kokoro/20260420_145808/kokoro/blind_04.wav", "sample_rate": 24000, "audio_duration_s": 6.025, "synth_time_s": 0.15998215798754245, "rtf": 0.026553055267641897, "peak_rss_mb": 2042.26171875, "peak_cuda_mb": 679.74560546875, "error": null}
{"model": "kokoro", "mode": "pipeline_iter", "text_id": "blind_05", "text": "No caminho para casa, comprei pão, café e um pedaço pequeno de bolo de milho.", "voice": "pf_dora", "lang_code": "p", "first_chunk_latency_ms": 138.14561598701403, "audio_path": "<internal-src>/tts/benchmarks/kokoro/20260420_145808/kokoro/blind_05.wav", "sample_rate": 24000, "audio_duration_s": 4.775, "synth_time_s": 0.13815385097404942, "rtf": 0.02893274365948679, "peak_rss_mb": 2042.26171875, "peak_cuda_mb": 679.74560546875, "error": null}
{"model": "kokoro", "mode": "pipeline_iter", "text_id": "blind_06", "text": "Se o modelo entende o contexto, ele deve destacar as palavras importantes sem exagerar na emoção.", "voice": "pf_dora", "lang_code": "p", "first_chunk_latency_ms": 89.28732702042907, "audio_path": "<internal-src>/tts/benchmarks/kokoro/20260420_145808/kokoro/blind_06.wav", "sample_rate": 24000, "audio_duration_s": 5.875, "synth_time_s": 0.08929561002878472, "rtf": 0.015199252770856974, "peak_rss_mb": 2042.2109375, "peak_cuda_mb": 680.51123046875, "error": null}
{"model": "kokoro", "mode": "pipeline_iter", "text_id": "blind_07", "text": "Ontem eu ouvi três versões da mesma frase e só uma delas parecia realmente dita por uma pessoa.", "voice": "pf_dora", "lang_code": "p", "first_chunk_latency_ms": 140.0202619843185, "audio_path": "<internal-src>/tts/benchmarks/kokoro/20260420_145808/kokoro/blind_07.wav", "sample_rate": 24000, "audio_duration_s": 6.0, "synth_time_s": 0.14002892700955272, "rtf": 0.02333815450159212, "peak_rss_mb": 2046.0703125, "peak_cuda_mb": 680.6015625, "error": null}
{"model": "kokoro", "mode": "pipeline_iter", "text_id": "blind_08", "text": "A qualidade ficou boa no começo, mas no fim do parágrafo a respiração artificial chamou bastante atenção.", "voice": "pf_dora", "lang_code": "p", "first_chunk_latency_ms": 142.67324696993455, "audio_path": "<internal-src>/tts/benchmarks/kokoro/20260420_145808/kokoro/blind_08.wav", "sample_rate": 24000, "audio_duration_s": 6.525, "synth_time_s": 0.1426809189724736, "rtf": 0.021866807505359936, "peak_rss_mb": 2046.0703125, "peak_cuda_mb": 680.6015625, "error": null}
{"model": "kokoro", "mode": "pipeline_iter", "text_id": "blind_09", "text": "Para um assistente de voz funcionar bem no Brasil, ele precisa lidar com nomes, datas e dinheiro sem tropeçar.", "voice": "pf_dora", "lang_code": "p", "first_chunk_latency_ms": 141.39429898932576, "audio_path": "<internal-src>/tts/benchmarks/kokoro/20260420_145808/kokoro/blind_09.wav", "sample_rate": 24000, "audio_duration_s": 6.75, "synth_time_s": 0.14140198094537482, "rtf": 0.02094844162153701, "peak_rss_mb": 2034.109375, "peak_cuda_mb": 682.09130859375, "error": null}
{"model": "kokoro", "mode": "pipeline_iter", "text_id": "blind_10", "text": "Se houver tempo, podemos repetir a avaliação com um texto mais longo e outro com frases bem curtas.", "voice": "pf_dora", "lang_code": "p", "first_chunk_latency_ms": 141.92002202617005, "audio_path": "<internal-src>/tts/benchmarks/kokoro/20260420_145808/kokoro/blind_10.wav", "sample_rate": 24000, "audio_duration_s": 6.25, "synth_time_s": 0.14192806801293045, "rtf": 0.022708490882068874, "peak_rss_mb": 2056.6953125, "peak_cuda_mb": 682.09130859375, "error": null}
